+@(test)
+test_health_grace_refill_gradual :: proc(t: ^testing.T) {
+	// The never-lose guard: the grace refills ONLY after a sustained healthy
+	// streak (grace_refill_streak_ticks) and then GRADUALLY
+	// (+grace_refill_per_tick per healthy tick) — a flapping line can never
+	// re-arm a full grace forever. Pinned on the FIRST refill tick: it must
+	// read exactly grace_refill_per_tick (5) — never a jump to the full 400.
+	cat_storage: Catalogs
